DDXPlus
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Used for model training and evaluation.

Fansi Tchango, A., Goel, R., Wen, Z., Martel, J., & Ghosn, J. (2022).
DDXPlus: A New Dataset For Automatic Medical Diagnosis.
Advances in Neural Information Processing Systems 35 (Datasets and
Benchmarks Track). https://arxiv.org/abs/2205.09148

Dataset: https://figshare.com/articles/dataset/DDXPlus_Dataset/20043374
Licence: Creative Commons Attribution (CC-BY), as stated by the dataset
authors. The licence version is recorded in DECISIONS.md (D-010) once
confirmed against the figshare record.

DDXPlus is synthetic: patients were generated from a proprietary medical
knowledge base by a rule-based system. Changes made in this project
(deduplication, feature encoding, train/validation/test handling) are
documented in docs/.

